WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.914 --> 00:00:08.609
Hi!

00:00:08.724 --> 00:00:09.617
I'm Ana.

00:00:09.755 --> 00:00:11.497
Welcome to 'What to Say!'

00:00:32.162 --> 00:00:36.513
Do you know what to say when you talk about where you're from?

00:00:36.904 --> 00:00:39.513
Listen out for useful language for

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:41.779
talking about where you're from.

00:00:42.253 --> 00:00:45.252
Then, we'll practise saying the new phrases –

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:46.815
after this.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.163
So where are you from, Vanya?

00:00:50.128 --> 00:00:51.728
I was born in Cambridge,

00:00:51.753 --> 00:00:53.220
but I live in Glasgow.

00:00:53.699 --> 00:00:55.508
I've never been to Glasgow.

00:00:56.161 --> 00:00:57.161
What's it like?

00:00:57.505 --> 00:00:59.713
Oh, it's wonderful.

00:00:59.924 --> 00:01:02.652
There's always something interesting to do

00:01:02.794 --> 00:01:05.900
and the people are really friendly.

00:01:06.401 --> 00:01:08.502
It sounds like a nice place to live.

00:01:08.916 --> 00:01:10.580
It is. I love it!

00:01:11.486 --> 00:01:12.783
What about you?

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:14.939
Where are you from in Turkey?

00:01:15.213 --> 00:01:16.519
I'm from Istanbul.

00:01:17.348 --> 00:01:19.754
Oh, I love Istanbul!

00:01:20.356 --> 00:01:21.887
I went once,

00:01:22.418 --> 00:01:23.980
but a long time ago.

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:28.469
My favourite thing was baklava.

00:01:28.962 --> 00:01:32.219
I really, really love baklava!

00:01:32.501 --> 00:01:34.985
Today's your lucky day, Vanya.

00:01:35.947 --> 00:01:37.688
I made it myself!

00:01:39.573 --> 00:01:40.439
Oh!

00:01:40.487 --> 00:01:42.431
These look delicious!

00:01:42.573 --> 00:01:43.447
Hi!

00:01:43.971 --> 00:01:44.971
Hi, Yuna!

00:01:45.041 --> 00:01:45.627
Can I?

00:01:45.674 --> 00:01:46.674
Of course!

00:01:47.096 --> 00:01:49.629
Emir's baklava is the best.

00:01:49.713 --> 00:01:50.517
Thank you!

00:01:50.565 --> 00:01:51.447
You're welcome.

00:01:52.555 --> 00:01:54.305
I love this place!

00:01:56.344 --> 00:01:57.344
Hello again!

00:01:57.578 --> 00:02:00.477
Mmm, that baklava looks delicious!

00:02:00.868 --> 00:02:06.903
So, did you notice the useful phrases used for talking about where you're from?

00:02:07.803 --> 00:02:08.803
Listen to me

00:02:08.834 --> 00:02:10.123
and then repeat.

00:02:11.068 --> 00:02:12.468
Where are you from?

00:02:15.075 --> 00:02:16.779
Where are you from?

00:02:19.585 --> 00:02:21.374
I was born in London.

00:02:24.546 --> 00:02:26.303
I was born in London.

00:02:29.499 --> 00:02:31.293
I live in Glasgow now.

00:02:34.457 --> 00:02:36.582
I live in Glasgow now.

00:02:39.575 --> 00:02:40.855
What's it like?

00:02:43.658 --> 00:02:45.033
What's it like?

00:02:47.893 --> 00:02:50.666
It sounds like a nice place to live.

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:57.499
It sounds like a nice place to live.

00:03:01.187 --> 00:03:02.585
What about you?

00:03:05.395 --> 00:03:06.886
What about you?

00:03:09.822 --> 00:03:11.306
I'm from Istanbul.

00:03:13.986 --> 00:03:15.516
I'm from Istanbul.

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:20.216
I love Istanbul.

00:03:22.873 --> 00:03:24.755
I love Istanbul.

00:03:28.070 --> 00:03:34.794
Try and use some of these phrases the next time you talk about where you're from in English.

00:03:34.933 --> 00:03:36.490
Bye for now!

